{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2021-11-30 07:00:00', 'title': 'GARMIN NAMED OFFICIAL EQUIPMENT SUPPLIER OF UNIVERSITY OF NEW MEXICO TRACK AND FIELD AND CROSS-COUNTRY TEAMS', 'text': 'OLATHE, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN® INTERNATIONAL, INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NASDAQ: GRMN), TODAY ANNOUNCED A MULTIYEAR AGREEMENT TO BECOME THE OFFICIAL EQUIPMENT SUPPLIER OF THE TOP-RANKED UNIVERSITY OF NEW MEXICO TRACK AND FIELD AND CROSS-COUNTRY TEAMS THROUGH THE SPRING 2024 SEASON. “THE UNIVERSITY OF NEW MEXICO IS HOME TO HIGHLY ACCOMPLISHED TRACK AND FIELD AND CROSS-COUNTRY RUNNERS FROM AROUND THE WORLD, AND WE ARE THRILLED TO WELCOME THESE COLLEGE ATHLETES TO THE GARMIN FAMILY,” SAI'}